    {
      "title": "1. SUBTOPICS & INSIGHTS\nTopic: study group session where three \nstudents discuss their strategies and \ninsights for an upcoming exam.\nStudy \nresource\nSubtopics\nStudy \ntechnique\nManage\nstress\n\u2026\nInsights\nPomodoro\nCalm meditation\nDeep breathing\nDaily 30-min walk\n2. DOC GENERATION\nHaystack\nDoc 1 Doc 2 Doc 3\nDoc 4\n\u2026\nDoc N\n Long-\n context\n LLM\n3. SUMMARY OF A \nHAYSTACK\nSummarize top insights about\nusing bullet point. Cite all sources.\nQuery\nThe top topics are:\n- mentioned in [3,4]\n- comes up in [N]\n- appears in [3] and [4].\n- in [1,N]\nIdeal Summary\n Retriever\n100 docs = ~100k tokens\n\u226415k tokens\n Generator",
